WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Darkness gives way to a gothic castle emerging from swirling fog and storm clouds.

2
00:05.500 --> 00:10.000
Ultimecia's Castle looms against an enormous moon, gargoyles perched on its towers.

3
00:10.500 --> 00:14.500
The camera sweeps past stone walls, lit windows, and bat-winged architecture.

4
00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
The castle floats on a skeletal foundation, chains dangling into the void.
